The two operations requests are left out. This node's contract grants only `LLMClient<inference>`. Writing a log file would need a filesystem capability, and the target has no WASI. Fetching the metadata service would need an `http-client` import scoped to that host. Adding either to the world would widen the node's authority beyond what the graph grants. The fetch would also send the untrusted customer question to an outside URL. If operations needs this, the graph should grant those capabilities explicitly, or a host-tier node should do the logging and enrichment.

